        "Title": "Mendoza&apos;s Trafficking",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ELEGANT_LLAMA",
        "PublicId": "131644320001",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/elegant/scene_llama.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 98b2a4c6-cb4b-403a-bf1b-44557e52a1f9).Image",
        "Description": "Over 3 years ago a client of ours has had a human trafficking incident; the attempt however failed. The only thing we have is a description of their face. There&apos;s been a recent sightings of the culprit in Mendoza. The target is Roy Harper; however, he does not seem to be alone. Pablo Farías is set out to find another set of victim&apos;s, Jerrald Dukaroff takes care of the exportation, while Isabelle Munoz makes sure there is no more trace. I will do my own investigation so do not get spotted 47.",
